# model/ and data/ ARE committed — they're the published Pages site content. Generate them with
# `scripts/export_webapp.py --quantize` (quantizing keeps the model ~9 MB; commit that, not float32).
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.onnx globally (model artifacts); re-include the webapp model
# here, but never the intermediate float32 the quantizer leaves if interrupted.
!*.onnx
*.f32.onnx
